/-!
# `p256` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `p256` crate:

* `P256.Spec.Operations`, `Arith`, `Points`, `KeysEncoding`: the P-256 parameters, byte forms and
  point encodings, built on SP 800-186 and SEC 1 in `Standards/`;
* `P256.Spec.Keys`, `Ecdsa`, `Ecdh`, `Generate`: the specifications of the crate's key, ECDSA, ECDH
  and key-generation functions;
* `P256.Spec.Functions`: what the slices of each entry point with a theorem must hold;
* `P256.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by `scripts/extract.py`;
* `P256.Spec.Program` and `P256.Spec.Program.Functions`: call semantics of the entry points the
  theorems and proofs use.

`P256.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
